<title>UK: Abbey National prices 200 mln stg Dec 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National prices 200 mln stg Dec 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     7.75	MATURITY    31.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.547   PAY DATE  S-15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.972    SPREAD	+30 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    *YES	CRS DEFLT  *YES	FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLAND   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
